wandb/
# Note: pretrained model files (e.g. adaptation-engine/models/*.joblib,
# cv-pipeline/models/*.task) are deliberately NOT ignored — Streamlit
# Cloud only clones this repo and runs pip install; there's no deploy
# step that would call download_model() or train() for it, so an
# ignored model file means the deployed app silently can't load it.
# Found the hard way: cv-pipeline's model was ignored here, and every
# video upload on the live deployed app failed with "model not
# downloaded" until this rule was removed and the file committed.

# Secrets / local config
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.pytest_cache/
.streamlit/
